{
  "slug": "zocks-advisor",
  "name": "Zocks Advisor",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Seven skills for financial advisors built on Zocks meeting intelligence: client behavioral profiles, attrition-risk ranking, held-away asset radar, client journey dossiers, household review packs, next-best-action analysis and a tax opportunity scan. Requires the Zocks connector and a Zocks account.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **7 skills** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (7): `client-attrition-risk` (Finds the clients an advisor is quietly losing from their own book, ranking the households that have gone…), `client-behavioral-profile` (Reads one advisory client or household two ways — a fast temperature check on whether they are cooling,…), `client-journey` (Builds a client-ready Client Journey for one household — a five-stage lifecycle timeline marking where the family sits…), `held-away-radar` (Ranked pipeline of held-away asset opportunities from the advisor's own recent meetings — old 401(k)s, outside brokerage accounts,…), `household-review-pack` (Prepares an annual or semi-annual household review from the last 12 to 24 months — goals then versus…), `next-best-action` (Deep single-household analysis naming the one highest-value next action and proving why — unused tax space, a closing…), `tax-opportunity-scan` (Builds a household's full tax opportunity picture from every analyzed meeting on record, across two horizons — current-year…)\n- **MCP servers** (1): `Zocks`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install zocks-advisor@claude-plugins-official` from `zocks-communications/zocks-agent-plugins`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "codex"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
